        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 38th Annual Daytime Emmy Awards\n- Places: Las Vegas Hilton, Westgate Las Vegas Resort & Casino, Winchester, Nevada\n- Topics: hotel naming history, broadcast venue\n\nFacts:\n- The 38th Annual Daytime Emmy Awards were held on Sunday, June 19, 2011, at the Las Vegas Hilton and were televised on CBS.\n- Westgate Las Vegas Resort & Casino is a hotel and casino in Winchester, Nevada.\n- Westgate Las Vegas Resort & Casino has 2,956 hotel rooms, including 305 suites.\n- Westgate Las Vegas Resort & Casino opened in 1969 as the International Hotel and was later known for many years as the Las Vegas Hilton and briefly as LVH – Las Vegas Hotel and Casino.",
